ary Authors Decide&#xa;Revise When Necessary" style="ellipse;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4424" y="448" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="MMLongBench-Doc v3&#xa;135 PDFs · 1,082 Questions&#xa;184 Source + 898 New&#xa;494 Single · 365 Cross-page&#xa;223 Unanswerable" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4704" y="568" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="LVLM Visual Route&#xa;Render Every PDF Page at 144 DPI&#xa;GPT-4o/GPT-4V/Gemini: Page Images&#xa;Claude: At Most 20 Images&#xa;Open Models: Concatenate to 1 or 5" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4424" y="872" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="OCR + LLM Route&#xa;Tesseract Extracts Page Text&#xa;Truncate Beyond Model Context&#xa;Charts / Images Remain Lossy&#xa;Comparison Route, Not Gold Input" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4424" y="1112" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="Generate then Extract&#xa;Prompt: Document + Question; Be Concise&#xa;Candidate T=0 · max_ne